  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing ABS implementation in Cambodia (PPG)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the GBFF PPG is to develop the project concept into a full project: Advancing ABS implementation in Cambodia. As described in the project concept (PPG Request), this project aims to support the Royal Government of Cambodia to fully operationalize the ABS regulations and institutional mechanisms, as well as advance the implementation of ABS related interventions through a whole-of-society approach and in compliance with the Nagoya Protocol.</narrative>
  </description>
